  "description": "Can’t get enough gravel? Confluence Drop Bar CUES 10 gets it. Our light gravel ebike enables more rides, more miles, and more fun on a wide range of terrain. It starts with a MAHLE X30 hub-drive motor that’s lightweight and discreet, yet packs 45Nm of torque — think of it as a tailwind everywhere you go.\n\nConfluence’s geometry keeps you comfortable and stable on all those extra miles at higher speeds. And it’s equipped with all the mounts for supplying bigger rides or if you want to take the long, gravel-strewn route to work.\n\nIf your favorite routes include especially rowdy roads, Confluence accommodates a 40mm suspension fork, dropper post, and 700c x 50mm tires for confident control.\n\nThe Shimano CUES 1 x 10 drivetrain delivers smooth, accurate shifts and is durable enough to deal with your new daily gravel habit.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
